# Introduction

Johnston Engineering (JE) is pleased to submit this proposal for a Mobile Demonstration Unit intended to demonstrate the performance and effectiveness of Nitto Denko Corporation’s proprietary spiral-wound CO₂ separation membrane technology.

This document provides a cost proposal for the design, analysis, procurement, fabrication and assembly tasks required for the Mobile Demonstration Unit. Johnston Engineering has conducted multiple Scope of Work (SOW) Review meetings with Nitto Innovations and quoted Nitto-provided Piping and Instrumentation Diagram (P&ID) to establish the estimates in this proposal. 

A notional system schematic was provided by Nitto Innovations and is shown in Figure 1.   Yellow ink indicates hardware that is not priced in this phase of the estimate at Nitto’s request. 

